  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.1 changes animate-in to a backwards animation fill: the enter keyframes include a transform, and the previous forwards fill left an identity transform on the element after the animation, making it a containing block that broke position:fixed descendants (popover panels, non-modal dialogs) anchored inside animated containers. animate-out keeps its forwards fill because exits unmount right after the animation. 0.4.1: fixes class extraction from markup attributes whose value is a call expression with embedded quotes (class=\"@Cn.Of(\"...\", (cond, \"a\", \"b\")).Value\"); transition-transform covers the individual transform, translate, scale and rotate properties; duration-* emits the --tw-duration variable that animate-in/animate-out consume.",
